e:  240  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Gish_TempHPWhileConcentrating_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Gish_TempHPWhileConcentrating_Boots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Gish_TempHPWhileConcentrating_Boots\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">306d3417-5e12-499e-832e-86b602a075de</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:306d3417-5e12-499e-832e-86b602a075de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:306d3417-5e12-499e-832e-86b602a075de\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Gish_TempHPWhileConcentrating_Boots</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Gish_TempHPWhileConcentrating_Boots+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Gish_TempHPWhileConcentrating_Boots+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Githyanki_HalfPlate_A_Footwear</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/25px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/38px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/50px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Athletics\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png/25px-Athletics_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Athletics_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Athletics\" title=\"Athletics\">Athletics</a> +1</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Vital_Conduit\" title=\"Vital Conduit\">Vital Conduit</a></dt><dd>Grants the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"8 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> when they cast a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">Spell</a> that requires <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;1380&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-798</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/25px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/38px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/50px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A'jak'nir Jeera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/25px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">A'jak'nir Jeera</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Vital Conduit:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>Vital Conduit</b> is triggered even by casting concentration cantrips, like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike\" title=\"True Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-True_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-True_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike\" title=\"True Strike\">True Strike</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Cantrip)\" title=\"Resistance (Cantrip)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/25px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/38px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/50px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp/25px-Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Resistance_Cantrip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Cantrip)\" title=\"Resistance (Cantrip)\">Resistance</a>.</li>\n<li>Vital Conduit is not triggered by most concentrations spells allowing free recast. Tested with: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/25px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/38px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/50px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/25px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/38px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/50px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Hunter%27s_Mark_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark\" title=\"Hunter's Mark\">Hunter's Mark</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/25px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/38px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/50px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp/25px-Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam\" title=\"Moonbeam\">Moonbeam</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal\" title=\"Heat Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Metal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Heat_Metal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal\" title=\"Heat Metal\">Heat Metal</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Call_Lightning\" title=\"Call Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Call Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Call_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Call_Lightning\" title=\"Call Lightning\">Call Lightning</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/38px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/50px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampiric Touch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp/25px-Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Vampiric_Touch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vampiric_Touch\" title=\"Vampiric Touch\">Vampiric Touch</a>.</li>\n<li>The exception known to trigger this ability multiple times is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/25px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/38px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/50px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloudkill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/25px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\">Cloudkill</a>. It is possible to move the cloud every turn without expending spell slots and trigger this ability.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 341.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 339.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png/509px-Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png/764px-Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png/1018px-Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png/509px-Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"340\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Vital_conduit_boots_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200224\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2605/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 53570/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13162/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion d